لصدر الرياضية ، واللباس الداخلي ، والسراويل القصيرة ، وقمصان الدبابات والمزيد من Nike ، حصريًا في AJIO. هذه القطع المتوفرة في مطبوعات جديدة وألوان زاهية وأقمشة مريحة ، ستضمن حصولك على تمرين مريح. احصل على خصومات وعروض وعروض جديدة لملابس Nike الرياضية الآن في AJ</div>','','','',''),(54,1,'UCB Full Sleeve Solid Men\'s Jacket','','\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: SourceSansPro; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Trendy, youthful and innovative are what you can expect from the smart fashion for men, women and children from&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: transparent; font: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px;\">United Colors of Benetton</span>. Cool track pants, stylish T-shirts, colourful backpacks, floral print trousers, canvas boat shoes – browse through the brand’s collection on AJIO to explore the latest in high street fashion.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ajio.com/united-colors-of-benetton-hooded-jacket-with-insert-pockets/p/460232826_grey?gclid=EAIaIQobChMIqIqXpOmd5QIVixmPCh1-yAAAEAYYASABEgJhJfD_BwE#\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(23, 109, 147); text-decoration-line: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px; cursor: pointer; text-align: center;\">+</a></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: transparent; font-family: SourceSansPro; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin: 0px; font-size: inherit; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; border-