ox-sizing:\" border-box;\"=\">تصميم لوحة المفاتيح على غرار chiclet أنيق. يحافظ التصميم المنخفض على ضغطات المفاتيح سريعة ومريحة ودقيقة للغاية ... فقط نوعك.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;\"=\">تم دمج لوحة Num وعناصر التحكم الشائعة مع 12 مجموعة اختصارات مع مفتاح Fn - الموسيقى والأفلام ومستوى الصوت والصفحة الرئيسية والإشارات المرجعية والبريد الإلكتروني. الآن هذا اختصار أعلاه.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','','','',''),(204,1,'HP Z3700 Wireless Optical Mouse  ','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Designed with flair, the sleek design complements your favorite HP devices and fits comfortably anywhere</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The 2.4GHz wireless connection reliably keeps you hooked up</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">With up to 16 months of life on a single AA battery, this mouse was designed to push the limits</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Blue LED technology lets your mouse function on a wide range of surfaces, so you can work from almost anywhere</