ges/8142842af0eb4291b72ef7ddf5b9c47a_175bb2debc8_image.jpeg?q=90\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit; border: none; outline: none; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle;\" /></div>\r\n					<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n						<div class=\"_3qWObK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 20px;\">Dual Connection</div>\r\n						<div class=\"_3zQntF\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.29;\">\r\n							<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">This wireless headset also gives you the option of connecting it to a media device with the help of an AUX cable.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>   ','','','',''),(222,1,'JBL GO2 Portable Bluetooth Speaker ','','\r\n<div><br />\r\n	</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The JBL GO 2 is a full-featured waterproof Bluetooth speaker to take with you everywhere. Wirelessly stream music via Bluetooth for up to 5 hours of continuous JBL quality sound. Making a splash with its new IPX7 waterproof design, GO 2 gives music lovers the opportunity to bring their speaker poolside, or to the beach. GO 2 also offers crystal clear phone call experience with its built-in noise-cancelling speakerphone. Crafted in a compact design with 12 eye-catching colors to choose from, GO 2 instantly raises your style profile to all-new levels.</span></div> ','','','',''),(223,1,'Apple AirPods (3rd Generation)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">AirPods are lightweight and offer a contoured design. They sit at just the right angle for comfort and to better direct audio to your ear. The stem is 33percent shorter than AirPods (2ndgeneration) and includes a force sensor to easily control music and calls.</span></div> ','','','',''),(224,1,'APPLE Watch Series 7 GPS + Cellular','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Stay connected to family and friends with calls, texts and email, even when you don’t have your phone</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Stream music and podcasts on the go, and leave your phone at home</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Always-on Retina display has nearly 20% more screen area than Series 6, making everything easier to see and use</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The most crack-resistant front crystal yet on an Apple Watch, IP6X dust resistance and swimproof design</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Measure your blood oxygen with a powerful sensor and app</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Take an ECG anytime, anywhere</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Get high and low heart rate, and irregular heart rhythm notifications</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"a-row a-expander-container a-expander-inline-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 410.047px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<div aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"a-expander-content a-expander-extend-content a-expander-content-expanded\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n		<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Stay in the moment with the new Mindfulness app reach your sleep goals with the Sleep app</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Track new tai chi and pilates workouts, in addition to favourites like running, yoga, swimming and dance</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Track your daily activity on Apple Watch and see your trends in the Fitness app on iPhone</span></li>\r\n		</ul></div></div>    ','','','',''),(225,1,'LG Super Convertible 6-in-1 Cooling 1.5 Ton 5 Star Split Dual Inverter AI','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Split AC with inverter compressor: variable speed compressor which adjusts power depending on heat load. It is most energy efficient and has lowest-noise operation</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Capacity: 1.5 Ton Suitable for medium sized rooms (111 to 150 sq ft.)</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Energy Rating: 5 Star - Best in class efficiency | Annual Energy Consumption: 818.81 Units per year | ISEER Value: 4.73 (Please Refer Energy Label On Product Page Or Contact Brand For More Details) . The star rating is as per BEE guidelines on or before 30th June 2022.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Manufacturer Warranty: 1 Year on Product, 5 Years on PCB and 10 Years on Compressor with gas charging</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Copper With ocean black protection: Prevents from rust &amp; corrosion; Increase durability; Uninterrupted cooling</span></li>\r\n</ul> ','','','',''),(226,1,'Blue Star 1 Ton 3 Star Window AC - White  (WFA312LL, Copper Condenser)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">You can enjoy utmost cooling even during hot months with the Blue Star 1 ton WFA312GL Window Air Conditioner. With its preset Turbo Cool mode, this air conditioner can rapidly cool your room. And, with its Eco mode, this air conditioner can help you cut down on electricity bills while offering optimal cooling. Moreover, thanks to its energy-efficient rotary compressor, this air conditioner ensures optimal cooling while consuming less power.</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Windows AC: Economical &amp; easy to install</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Capacity: 1 Ton Suitable for medium sized rooms (upto 120 sq.ft)</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Energy Rating: 5 Star. Annual Energy Consumption: 785.72 units. ISEER Value: 3.35 | The star rating is as per BEE guidelines on or before 30th June 2022.</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Manufacturer Warranty : 1 year on product, 1 year on condenser, 5 years on compressor</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Copper Condenser Coil: Better cooling and requires low maintenance</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Key Features: Noise Level: 55(db); Ambient Temperature: 52 degree Celsius</span></li>\r\n		<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Special Features: Turbo Cool, Comfort Sleep,Self Diagnosis, Dust Filter</span></li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	<div class=\"a-row a-expander-container a-expander-inline-container\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 513.25px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n		<div aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"a-expander-content a-expander-extend-content a-expander-content-expanded\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n			<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n				<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Refrigerant Gas: R32 - Environmental Friendly - No Ozone Depletion Potential</span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Item Dimensions &amp; Weight : Window AC - 66*66*43cm (w x d x h), 48 Kg</span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Included In The Box: One AC Unit, Remote Control, User manual, Warranty Card</span></li>\r\n			</ul></div></div><br />\r\n	</div> ','','','',''),(227,1,'Mens Fedora Hats Cap','','\r\n','','','',''),(228,1,'NIVEA Soft Moisturizing Cream for all skin types','','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" small;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">The best moisture cream for you has to not only work in sync with your skin but also with your lifestyle. There are different types of skin, each with its unique set of needs, but overall there are some skincare ingredients we should all be looking out for. If your skin tends to get dehydrated, Nivea soft is the perfect refreshing moisturising cream.enriched with jojoba oil and vitamin e, Nivea soft is an invigorating and fast absorbing moisture cream that refreshes your skin, leaving a unique fragrance and making it smooth, soft, supple and healthy. The light texture and fast-absorbing formula of this moisturiser cream make it highly effective. This moisturising cream for dry skin comes with the signature Nivea fragrance. The texture of this moisturising cream is extremely light, which makes it easy to spread all over the body, without making your skin greasy or sticky. This moisture cream for face has other usages as well. Use it on your dry hands and chapped feet during the chilled winter days to obtain great results. You can also apply it regularly after your cleansing ritual for smooth, soft skin. So many creams are heavy and chalky, but Nivea soft is specially made for the summer heat. With just one application, the cream dissipates into your skin, even in the sweltering heat. Keep your skin healthy and happy with the fresh smelling Nivea soft moisture cream. Try it, you’ll love it.</span> ','','','',''),(229,1,'POND\'S Bright Beauty Mineral Clay','','\r\n','','','',''),(230,1,'Lacto Calamine Peel Off Mask with Activated Charcoal and Vitamin E deep pore cleansing – No Parabens No Sulphates  (60 g)','','<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Lacto Calamine Activated Charcoal Peel off mask penetrates deep to remove the toxins from the skin. It helps in controlling the oily skin problems including face pimples, blackheads, whiteheads. Added Vitamin E ensures to leave your skin soft and supple without removing essential oils. This paraben free and sulphate free mask absorbs dirt quickly and helps you achieve clear matte skin daily^. The product can be used 1-2 times in a week ^with regular use. 1. Removes blackheads and whiteheads 2. Removes excess oil, dirt, toxins from deep pores for a clear matte look 3. Enriched with natural ingredients with anti oxidant, anti-microbial and healing properties, detoxifies skin 4. Express cooling effect on application .</span> ','','','',''),(231,1,'Lakmé Sun Expert Ultra Matte Lotion - SPF 50 PA+++  (50 ml)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">If you’re worried about going out in the hot sun and getting a tan, you needn’t anymore. This Lakme Sun Expert Fairness UV Sunscreen Lotion that comes with SPF 50 PA+++ protects your skin from sunburn, tan lines and dark spots. This dermatologically tested lotion is also hypoallergenic and is suitable for most skin types.&nbsp;It is also enriched with Vitamin B3, cucumber and lemongrass extracts which give you a lighter skin tone.</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Perfect for Long Wear</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">This long-lasting lotion is designed to be light on your skin, giving it a fresh and smooth feel.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sweat Proof Formulation</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The water immiscible formulation makes it ideal for use in hot and humid weather.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Blocks 97% of UVB Rays</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">It blends easily into your skin and protects it from harmful UVA and UVB rays, preventing tanning and sunburn.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Moisturizes Skin</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">It moisturises your skin, giving it a smooth and fresh feel.</p></div>   ','','','',''),(231,2,'لاكمي – لوشن صن إكسبرت ألترا ماتي – عامل حماية من الشمس 50 PA+++ (50 مل)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"background-color:\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;\"=\">إذا كنت قلقا بشأن الخروج في الشمس الحارقة والحصول على تان ، فأنت لست بحاجة إلى ذلك بعد الآن. هذا اللوشن الواقي من الشمس من لاكمي صن إكسبرت فيرنيس الذي يأتي مع عامل حماية من الشمس SPF 50 PA+++ يحمي بشرتك من حروق الشمس وخطوط السمرة والبقع الداكنة. هذا المستحضر الذي تم اختباره من قبل أطباء الجلد هو أيضا مضاد للحساسية ومناسب لمعظم أنواع البشرة،&nbsp;كما أنه غني بفيتامين B3 والخيار ومستخلصات الليمون التي تمنحك لون بشرة أفتح.</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"><span style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;\"=\">مثالي للارتداء الطويل</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\">تم تصميم هذا المستحضر طويل الأمد ليكون خفيفا على بشرتك ، مما يمنحها شعورا منعشا وسلسا.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"><span style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;\"=\">تركيبة مقاومة للعرق</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\">تركيبة غير قابلة للامتزاج بالماء تجعلها مثالية للاستخدام في الطقس الحار والرطب.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"><span style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;\"=\">يمنع 97٪ من الأشعة فوق البنفسجية UVB</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\">يمتزج بسهولة مع بشرتك ويحميها من الأشعة فوق البنفسجية UVA و UVB الضارة ، مما يمنع الدباغة وحروق الشمس.</p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"><span style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;\"=\">يرطب البشرة</span></p>\r\n	<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\">يرطب بشرتك ، مما يمنحها شعورا ناعما ومنعشا.</p></div>   ','','','',''),(232,1,'DOVE Hair Fall Rescue Shampoo (340 ml)','','\r\n','','','',''),(232,2,'شامبو دوڤ لإنقاذ تساقط الشعر (340 مل)','','','','','',''),(233,1,'DOVE Hair Therapy Breakage Repair Conditioner, No Parabens & Dyes, 380 ml  (380 ml)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Wondering how to help make hair stronger and reduce hair fall all at once? Discover Dove Hair Therapy, Dove Hair Therapy Breakage Repair Conditioner expert care that reaches hairs cellular level, with moisturising potion and nourishing ingredients. We are all about those good hair days but hair fall can make us feel less than our beautiful best. Thats why we created Hair Therapy Breakage Repair conditioner for damaged hair. Giving your hair expert care it deserves, this strengthening conditioner blends all the care of Dove you know and love. Infused with Nutri-lock serum, this conditioner for damaged hair is inspired by the world of luxury skin care. It gives care at hairs cellular level and boosts hair strength - helping your hair look thicker, stronger, and healthier. Our expert yet gentle caring formula contains no parabens &amp; dyes which makes it suitable even for coloured hair. Try it today for beautiful, healthy-looking strands with 98% less breakage** and say hello to good hair days every day. After shampooing, apply from the mid lengths to the tips of your hair. Massage it in and leave for a minute or two while it works its magic. Then, rinse thoroughly. Bottle made from 25% recycled plastic so you can be kind to your hair and the environment. CRUELTY-FREE HAIR CARE: Globally, Dove does not test on animals **When used as a system vs. non-conditioning shampoo</span></div> ','','','',''),(233,2,'دوڤ – بلسم إصلاح تكسر الشعر، بدون بارابين وأصباغ، 380 مل (380 مل)','','\r\n<div><span style=\"background-color:\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);=\" color:=\" rgb(33,=\" 33,=\" 33);=\" font-family:=\" roboto,=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;\"=\">هل تتساءلين عن كيفية المساعدة في جعل الشعر أقوى وتقليل تساقط الشعر دفعة واحدة؟ اكتشفي علاج دوڤ للشعر، بلسم دوڤ لإصلاح تكسر الشعر الذي يصل إلى المستوى الخلوي للشعر، مع جرعة مرطبة ومكونات مغذية. نحن جميعا حول تلك الأيام الشعر الجيدة ولكن تساقط الشعر يمكن أن يجعلنا نشعر أقل من أفضل ما لدينا. لهذا السبب أنشأنا بلسم إصلاح تكسر الشعر للشعر التالف. يمنح هذا البلسم المقوى شعرك العناية الخبيرة التي تستحقها ، ويمزج بين كل رعاية دوڤ التي تعرفها وتحبها. هذا البلسم الغني بمصل Nutri-lock مستوحى من عالم العناية بالبشرة الفاخرة. إنه يوفر العناية على المستوى الخلوي للشعر ويعزز قوة الشعر - مما يساعد شعرك على أن يبدو أكثر سمكا وقوة وصحة. لا تحتوي تركيبتنا الخبيرة واللطيفة على البارابين والأصباغ مما يجعلها مناسبة حتى للشعر الملون. جربيه اليوم للحصول على خصلات جميلة وصحية المظهر مع كسر أقل بنسبة 98٪ ** وقل مرحبا بأيام الشعر الجيدة كل يوم. بعد غسل الشعر بالشامبو، ضعيه من منتصف الطول على أطراف شعرك. قم بتدليكه واتركه لمدة دقيقة أو دقيقتين أثناء عمله السحري. ثم اشطفيه جيدا. زجاجة مصنوعة من البلاستيك المعاد تدويره بنسبة 25٪ حتى تتمكن من أن تكون لطيفا مع شعرك والبيئة. العناية بالشعر الخالية من القسوة: على الصعيد العالمي ، لا تختبر Dove الحيوانات ** عند استخدامها كنظام مقابل الشامبو غير المكيف</span></div>\r\n','','','',''),(234,1,'KERASTASE Elixir Ultime Oleo-Complexe Radiance Beautifying Oil (For Colour-Treated Hair)  (100 ml)','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">This is for color treated hair enriched with oleocomplexe</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Imperial tea extract that enhances the depth of color radiance</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">This conditions processed hair and protects from dryness</span></li>\r\n</ul>  ','','','',''),(234,2,'زيت كيراستاز إليكسير أولتايم أوليو كومبلكس لتجميل الإشراق (للشعر المصبوغ) (100 مل)','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list\" a-vertical=\" a-spacing-mini\"=\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 18px;=\" color:=\" rgb(15,=\" 17,=\" 17);=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" font-family:=\" \"amazon=\" ember\",=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;\"=\">هذا هو للشعر المصبوغ المعالج الغني بمركب أوليوكومبليك</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;\"=\">مستخلص الشاي الإمبراطوري الذي يعزز عمق إشراقة اللون</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;\"=\">هذا يلطف الشعر المعالج ويحمي من الجفاف</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','','','',''),(235,1,'Lino Perros Faux Leather Handbag','','<span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">Lino Perros is synonymous with the fashionistas for its superior range of designer handbags for women. We have grown organically and aim at making the future of fashion look more appealing and meaningful. Our products are the most popular choice amongst generations who define fashion with style, quality, and relevance. Standing out, our accessories for men and women have built a close fan-following owing to its aesthetic approach.</span>  ','','','',''),(235,2,'لينو بيروس حقيبة يد من الجلد الصناعي','','<span style=\"color:\" rgb(15,=\" 17,=\" 17);=\" font-family:=\" \"amazon=\" ember\",=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"\">لينو بيرو مرادف لعشاق الموضة لمجموعتها المتفوقة من حقائب اليد المصممة للنساء. لقد نمت عضويا ونهدف إلى جعل مستقبل الموضة يبدو أكثر جاذبية ومعنى. منتجاتنا هي الخيار الأكثر شعبية بين الأجيال التي تحدد الموضة بالأناقة والجودة والملاءمة. تتميز إكسسواراتنا للرجال والنساء بأنها تحظى بمتابعة قريبة من المعجبين بسبب نهجها الجمالي.</span>\r\n','','','',''),(236,1,'Tarsa Ben10 Kid\'s Watch (Green)','','\r\n<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"g1ju43-gmj7a8-7qnt8s-aokpv8\" data-cel-widget=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n		<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">Color: Green</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">For Kid\'s</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">Ben10 Watch</span></li>\r\n		</ul></div></div> ','','','',''),(236,2,'ساعة ترسا بن 10 للأطفال (أخضر)','','\r\n<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"g1ju43-gmj7a8-7qnt8s-aokpv8\" data-cel-widget=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" color:=\" rgb(15,=\" 17,=\" 17);=\" font-family:=\" \"amazon=\" ember\",=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section\" a-spacing-medium=\" a-spacing-top-small\"=\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin-top:=\" 8px=\" !important;=\" margin-bottom:=\" 0px;\"=\">\r\n		<ul class=\"a-unordered-list\" a-vertical=\" a-spacing-mini\"=\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 18px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;\"=\">\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">اللون: أخضر</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">للأطفال</span></li>\r\n			<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">ساعة Ben10</span></li>\r\n		</ul></div></div>','','','',''),(237,1,'SYGA Kids Goggles, Modern Stylish Eyewears for Boy\'s and Girls, Crown Style','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">Fit Type: Regular</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">These eyewears are nice choices for outdoor sports and activities such as going to beach, bathing the sunlight, shopping, travelling or just for decoration, the street, the party, the holidays and the formal event.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">These kids sunglasses are flat and durable, made of quality AC material which is skin-friendly and not easy to break, allowing your kids to wear for a long time</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">Featuring cute variegated designs and chic colors, you kids will be looking more lovely and eye-catching in the crowds when wearing these eyewear glasses</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">Every color suits kids daily or party wear well and these colors are all trendy colors in all the seasons. Glasses feature UV400 protection lenses that efficiently filter out the sun radiation.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: block;\">There are several colors available for multiple style glasses: beige, black, brown, pink, green, yellow, and can go with various features and clothing. They are also the perfect choice for outdoor activities, such as party, traveling, and so on</span></li>\r\n</ul> ','','','',''),(237,2,'نظارات الأطفال SYGA ، نظارات عصرية أنيقة للبنين والبنات ، نمط التاج','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list\" a-vertical=\" a-spacing-mini\"=\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" margin:=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 0px=\" 18px;=\" color:=\" rgb(15,=\" 17,=\" 17);=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" font-family:=\" \"amazon=\" ember\",=\" arial,=\" sans-serif;=\" font-size:=\" 14px;=\" background-color:=\" rgb(255,=\" 255,=\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">نوع الملائمة: عادي</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">هذه النظارات هي خيارات لطيفة للرياضات والأنشطة في الهواء الطلق مثل الذهاب إلى الشاطئ ، والاستحمام تحت أشعة الشمس ، والتسوق ، والسفر أو لمجرد الديكور ، والشارع ، والحفلات ، والعطلات ، والحدث الرسمي.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">هذه النظارات الشمسية للأطفال مسطحة ومتينة ، مصنوعة من مواد تكييف عالية الجودة صديقة للبشرة وليس من السهل كسرها ، مما يسمح لأطفالك بالارتداء لفترة طويلة</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">تتميز بتصاميم متنوعة لطيفة وألوان أنيقة ، سيبدو أطفالك أكثر جمالا وملفتا للنظر في الحشود عند ارتداء نظارات النظارات هذه</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">كل لون يناسب الأطفال يوميا أو الحفلات يرتديان بشكل جيد وهذه الألوان كلها ألوان عصرية في جميع الفصول. تتميز النظارات بعدسات حماية UV400 تعمل على تصفية أشعة الشمس بكفاءة.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" list-style:=\" disc;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" margin:=\" 0px;\"=\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" overflow-wrap:=\" break-word;=\" display:=\" block;\"=\">هناك العديد من الألوان المتاحة للنظارات متعددة الأطياف: البيج والأسود والبني والوردي والأخضر والأصفر ، ويمكن أن تذهب مع مختلف الميزات والملابس. كما أنها الخيار الأمثل للأنشطة في الهواء الطلق ، مثل الحفلات والسفر وما إلى ذلك.</span></li>\r\n</ul>','','','',''),(238,1,'blue tree Kid\'s Cute Plush Animal Cartoon Mini Travel Backpack, Pink, 1-6 Years (Konggi Rabbit)','','\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: \" amazon=\"\" ember\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">DIMENSION:15x35x12inch/38x8x30cm(WxDxH).Weight:0.32kg/0.7lb. Front Pocket:12x9inch/30x23cm(WxH) Soft adjustable &amp; breathable shoulder straps:8inch-20.8inch/20cm-53cm.</span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">? CUTE DESIGN:Made of super soft plush material and high quality smooth zipper accessories. Small backpack suitable 