se through the collection of versatile designs that include slip-on sneakers, high-energy training shoes, casual slip-on convertible walking shoes and lots more.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: transparent; margin: 0px; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-size: inherit; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-family: SourceSansPro; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Styles in Skechers</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: SourceSansPro; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Besides the collection of training and performance shoes, Skechers also has a charming range of yoga-inspired&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ajio.com/women-flip-flop-slippers/c/830307001\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; color: rgb(23, 109, 147); text-decoration-line: none; background-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: 0px; cursor: pointer; text-align: center;\">flip flops for women&nbsp;</a>. You can take your pick from black meditation flip flops with embellished straps and thong-style cushioned flip flops with sparkling sequinned straps that are perfect for the beach or pool.Pamper your feet in the elegant styles in Skechers footwear!</p>  ','','','',''),(251,2,'فليكس كولبشن 4.0 دانتيل أب أحذية كاجوال','','\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing:\" border-box;=\" outline:=\" transparent;=\" margin:=\" 0px;=\" padding:=\" 0px;=\" border:=\" 0px;=\" font-variant-numeric:=\" inherit;=\" font-variant-east-asian:=\" inherit;=\" font-stretch:=\" i